# .env for zedu-mobile PR builds in contributor forks (pr-build-react-native.yml).
# Read from zedu-ci's main at build time. Public values only: everything here is bundled into the app,
# so anyone with a build can read it. Never add a secret.
#
# {{backend}} is the API host: api.hng.groups.zedu.chat (the dev backend), or the host from the PR
# body's `Backend URL:` line. {{client}} is the matching web app host (the backend host without "api.").
# Keys the app reads are declared in zedu-mobile's env.d.ts. GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID, CLIENT_ID,
# CLIENT_SECRET, ONESIGNAL_APP_ID and AGORA_APP_ID stay unset, as in zedu-fe's previews: Google
# sign-in, push and calls don't work in review builds.
API_URL=https://{{backend}}
BASE_URL=https://{{backend}}/api/v1
CONNECT_URL=wss://{{backend}}/centrifugo/connection/websocket
CLIENT_URL=https://{{client}}
